340
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,000
And these were kind

341
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,000
of old-fashioned, venerable institutions.

342
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:47,500
Do you know what happens

343
00:17:47,500 --> 00:17:50,000
